pancy targets for realistic crowd management.\\n\\n**Testing Elevator State Handling**\\n\\nI am developing comprehensive test cases for the elevator logic. My current focus is on verifying edge cases like door hold durations, ensuring destinations persist through the action handshake, and confirming that a reset correctly clears phantom states.\\n\\n**Advancing Simulation Mechanics**\\n\\nI'm integrating advanced simulation mechanics, focusing on occupancy management with `applyOccupancy()` and `topUpVisitors()`. My current work involves refining the 16-step per-frame dispatch loop, including robust stall recovery for `WALK_TO_WP` and a phased `ENTER_ELEVATOR` action with reservation and movement logic.\\n\\n**Navigating Elevator Actions**\\n\\nI'm detailing the agent's interaction with the elevator car. This includes defining precise movements within the car for boarding and disembarking, specifying how they press floor buttons, and handling their seated or standing states, including the reservation and release of seats.\\n\\n\",\"format\":\"google-gemini-v1\",\"index\":0},{\"type\":\"reasoning.encrypted\",\"data\":\".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiZ29vZ2xlL2dlbWluaS00LWh5ZHJvZ2VuLTIwMjYxMTEyfGdvb2dsZS12ZXJ0ZXgvZ2xvYmFsIn0\",\"format\":\"google-gemini-v1\",\"id\":\"call_2785710451987597624\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2785710451987597624","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Office Building Simulation</title>\n<style>html,body{margin:0;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#222233}canvas{display:block}</style>\n</head><body>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.147.0/build/three.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.147.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"person.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"world.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"elevator_logic.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"elevator.js\