ch, stall recovery, collision avoidance with entrance/elevator exemptions, and top-left HUD with speed/occupancy sliders.\n- `elevator_logic_test.js`: 7 deterministic Node tests covering lobby rush, destination priority, anti-starvation, opposite-direction waiting, door hold/safety cap, destination preservation, and `reset()`.\n\n### Verification\n- `node elevator_logic_test.js`: **7 passed, 0 failed**.\n- `node -c` on all 6 JS files: **ALL_SYNTAX_OK**.\n- Static grep for forbidden patterns (`import`, `export`, `file://`, `summary.html`, `<iframe>`, `<object>`, `<embed>`): none found.\n- `node ../../static_check.js .`: not accessible inside the sandbox (`MODULE_NOT_FOUND`), to be run by the external evaluator."}}
